  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Equation of plane passing through the intersection of two planes&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>13</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>29</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>8</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;can be written as&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>13</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>29</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>8</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>20</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;and if it is passing through&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;then</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>10</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>39</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>29</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>16</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>20</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>i.e.&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>7</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math>.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>:</mo></math>&nbsp;Equation of plane through intersection of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>13</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>29</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>8</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>and the point&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>13</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>29</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>7</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mn>8</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>20</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></math></p><p>Similarly&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>:</mo></math>&nbsp;Equation of plane through intersection of</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>13</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>29</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>8</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;and the point&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>13</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>29</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>&#956;</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>8</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>20</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>Solving we get&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#956;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>So&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>:</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math></p><p>Angle between planes&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>cos</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>6</mn></msqrt><msqrt><mn>6</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>cos</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math>&nbsp;</p>",
